    <string name="section_device">Device</string>
    <string name="section_howto">How to use</string>
    <string name="howto_step_1">1. Grant All files access, then tap Pull to fetch the system jars.</string>
    <string name="howto_step_2">2. Leave Main patch on — the recommended set — and switch any Additional patches you want.</string>
    <string name="howto_step_3">3. Tap Patch; Status and the Patch log show every step while it runs.</string>
    <string name="howto_step_4">4. When it finishes, open the Output tab — the built module and its flash result appear there.</string>
    <string name="howto_step_5">5. Tap Install module, then reboot so the patched jars mount.</string>
